  "code" : "public int longestConsecutive(int[] nums) {\n    Set<Integer> set = new HashSet<>();\n    for (int num : nums) set.add(num);\n    int longest = 0;\n\n    for (int it : set) {\n        if (!set.contains(it - 1)) {\n            int cnt = 1, x = it;\n            while (set.contains(x + 1)) {\n                x++; cnt++;\n            }\n            longest = Math.max(longest, cnt);\n        } else {\n        }\n    }\n    return longest;\n}",
